JavaFX (aka OpenJFX) is an open source, next generation client app
platform for desktop, mobile and embedded systems built on Java.
It allows you to create Java applications with a modern, hardware-
accelerated user interface that is highly portable.
JavaFX builds on top of JDK and is a standalone component.

NOTE:

You'll also need a JDK to make use of JavaFX.
Check https://gluonhq.com/products/javafx/
for the minimum required version.
